  "card": "Calls DisableNextWrite at the start of each input in five mempool and package evaluation fuzz targets. Static chainstate previously leaked the periodic flush timer across fuzz iterations, causing non-deterministic execution paths and preventing crashes from reliably reproducing in isolation. The author measured using deterministic-fuzz-coverage on qa-assets that branch hit counts dropped from unpredictable values to zero across runs, mirroring the fix in merged PR #32822.",
